  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n7 : 14 :: 8.7 : x\n\n5 : 35 :: 7 : y\n\n**Formula used:**\n\nIf a : b :: c : d, then (a)/(b) = (c)/(d)\n\n**Calculations:**\n\nFor x:\n\n⇒ (7)/(14) = (8.7)/(x)\n\n⇒ x = (8.7 times 14)/(7)\n\n⇒ x = 17.4\n\nFor y:\n\n⇒ (5)/(35) = (7)/(y)\n\n⇒ y = (7 times 35)/(5)\n\n⇒ y = 49\n\nRatio of x to y:\n\n⇒ (x)/(y) = (17.4)/(49)\n\n⇒ (174)/(490) = (87)/(245)\n\n**∴ The correct answer is option (2).**",
